WEBVTT

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.920
What?! Mitsutomo Corporation?

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:41.480
Did the heat get to your head?

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:42.640
Why?

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:44.390
Even if you apply there,

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:46.560
as soon as they see
what college you're at...

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:58.340
But the Director of Recruiting
told me that he'd like to see me again.

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:02.200
You know Mitsutomo Corporation's
Recruiting Director?

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:03.500
Uh-huh.

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:10.950
Your name?

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:12.290
I'm Godai!

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:15.980
Godai? I'll remember you.

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:20.920
You may not be
the most polished,

00:02:21.730 --> 00:02:25.070
but you show more promise than
a smooth-talking greenhorn.

00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:27.600
I'll see you
at the interview.

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:30.930
Yes, sir! Good night!

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:42.360
You mean, that high school
girl Yagami's father?

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:45.480
He's Mitsutomo Corporation's
Director of Recruiting.

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:48.420
What a small world.

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:52.550
What a connection
you got yourself!

00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:54.260
It's not like that.

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:58.980
But I think he liked
my personality.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.100
Godai.

00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:07.580
You think you can
get me in, too?

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:31.600
I'm home!

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:33.230
Welcome.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:35.890
Oh, did you get a haircut?

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:39.580
Yes. I have
an interview tomorrow.

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:40.860
Good luck.

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:41.420
Thanks.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:50.080
Manager, when I find a job and
become a respectable adult...

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:52.850
Become a respectable adult...

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:55.290
Then what?

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:56.550
Don't mock me!

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:59.710
We were all waiting
for you to come home.

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:00.660
Me?

00:04:00.730 --> 00:04:03.830
The party can't start
without the guest of honor.

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:06.160
Party? For what?

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:10.490
We're celebrating early
'cause you're getting hired.

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:11.430
Huh?

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:20.070
Dad, you really don't remember?

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:25.440
I don't remember a thing.
I told you.

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.660
But you clearly said
to Mr. Godai-

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:29.610
That's enough.

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:36.610
Did that Godai ask you

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:39.930
to talk me into favoring him
at the interview?

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:41.230
No, he didn't.

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:43.800
Then stay out of it.

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:48.990
I despise people who try to use
the Recruiting Director's daughter...

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:53.040
to snatch a job.

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:56.240
No, Dad! Mr. Godai
isn't like that.

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:59.440
If he's got the nerve to show, up
at the interview tomorrow

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:01.550
I'll put the rotten scoundrel
in his place!

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:05.420
Forget it! I hate you, Dad!

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:16.620
I can't wait for tomorrow.

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:24.850
Elite! Elite!

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:27.840
Elite! Rah! Rah! Rah!

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:29.670
Congratulations, Godai.

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:31.610
It's too early for that.

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:33.710
Don't worry.

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:37.660
The Director of Recruiting gave you
the seal of approval, right?

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:39.980
At a company like that,

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:42.680
your salary will undoubtedly
be quite high, won't it?

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:44.590
I don't know.

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:49.430
Don't let success
make you forget us.

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:50.270
I won't.

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:53.400
C'mon! Bottoms up!

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:56.670
Tomorrow's an
important day for you.

00:05:56.850 --> 00:05:59.170
You should take it easy.

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:03.710
You're right.

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:07.110
C'mon! We've only just started.

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:09.750
Once you're a working man,
there will be times

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:12.310
when you must take
your clients out to drink.

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:14.920
Right! You gotta
build up your tolerance!

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:19.020
So let the booze flow! C'mon!

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:21.970
Just a little more, then.

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:25.980
Bottoms up! Bottoms up!

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:29.840
He's so weak that way.

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:33.040
He just can't say no.

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:34.740
Impressive!

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:51.680
Wait, Dad!

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:54.100
Mr. Godai's not-

00:06:54.170 --> 00:06:55.930
I don't want to hear
any more about him.

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:06.820
Dad!

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:13.750
What'll I do?

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:16.940
Mr. Godai...

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:21.920
Welcome to our firm, Godai.
We want you on our team.

00:07:21.990 --> 00:07:22.880
Yes, sir!

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:04.800
I've never believed
in God before, but...

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:25.650
God, I'm going to splurge and
make an offering of 1 000 yen.

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:46.650
Please answer my prayer.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:15.200
Hi, Yagami.

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:29.950
Did you want to see Godai?

00:09:34.460 --> 00:09:38.900
He's still sleeping.
He had a late night.

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:45.030
Would you like me
to wake him up?

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:47.030
Um...

00:09:48.840 --> 00:09:52.800
Please...give this to Mr. Godai.

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.550
An amulet?

00:09:59.350 --> 00:10:00.710
Please tell him...

00:10:01.190 --> 00:10:03.890
that I wasn't able to help him
with today's interview...

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:09.060
but that...I wish him luck.

00:10:10.430 --> 00:10:11.690
Did something happen?

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:13.320
Good-bye!

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:18.170
Yagami...?

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:33.150
I've got one hour.

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:35.660
I want to get there
at least 20 minutes early.

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:42.530
Here I go!

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:51.560
I'm leaving!

00:10:53.810 --> 00:10:54.750
Godai!

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:55.930
Yes?

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:03.560
This morning, Yagami asked
me to give you this.

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:12.660
"Amulet for an easy birth"?
What was she thinking?

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:14.900
Amulet for an easy birth?

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:17.450
She must have
picked it up in a rush.

00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:20.760
Take it with you.
It's the thought that counts.

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:21.660
Okay.

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:29.560
Stay calm and focused,
and you'll do fine.

00:11:29.940 --> 00:11:32.800
Yes. I'll do it for you.

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:34.780
Calm and focused.

00:11:35.050 --> 00:11:36.340
I know.

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:43.820
A-Are you all right, Godai?

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:46.530
I'm okay.

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:50.030
Bye now!

00:12:14.690 --> 00:12:16.350
He probably left
right around now.

00:12:17.530 --> 00:12:20.950
I hope the manager remembered
to give him that amulet.

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:27.930
Mr. Godai, I'm praying...

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:32.090
that my father won't be
mean to you at the interview.

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:45.620
I'm waiting for you, Godai.

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:52.050
You've dared to con my
precious one and only daughter.

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:55.750
You'll face my wrath!

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:09.600
So you're Godai!

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:10.810
Y-Yes.

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:13.870
How dare you
con my daughter?

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:16.100
Y-You've got it all wrong!

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:16.950
Shut up!

00:13:17.030 --> 00:13:19.850
I'm going to crush you
with my own hands!

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:21.570
H-Help!

00:13:21.660 --> 00:13:23.050
Stop it, Dad!

00:13:28.860 --> 00:13:31.930
Let go, Dad!

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:37.040
Stop... Dad...

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:41.470
Hey! Wake up, Yagami!!

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:44.910
Yagami!

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:49.910
What's the matter, Yagami?

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:52.190
Nothing.

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:56.920
It was just a dream.

00:14:00.570 --> 00:14:05.620
God, please...
Please protect Mr. Godai.

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:16.410
Stay calm and focused,
and you'll do fine.

00:14:17.050 --> 00:14:21.500
I'm going to do my best!
My life depends on this interview!

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:32.750
Are you all right?

00:14:33.800 --> 00:14:36.920
Please get a taxi for me!

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:37.560
Huh?

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:40.220
I think the baby's coming!

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:41.820
Baby?!

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:44.670
It's coming!

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:47.730
What'll I do?!

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:49.570
Hurry! Get a taxi!

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:50.540
Okay!

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:55.980
Taxi!

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:12.300
I can't find a taxi.
What'll I do?

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:14.750
It's almost time for my interview.

00:15:16.230 --> 00:15:18.590
I know! I'll call an ambulance!

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:27.050
Mr. Yagami, please proceed
to the interview room.

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:28.150
All right.

00:15:37.570 --> 00:15:38.430
Ma'am?

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:44.700
I've called
an ambulance for you.

00:15:45.470 --> 00:15:47.530
Thank you.

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:51.140
- Bye.
- Don't go!

00:15:52.520 --> 00:15:57.500
This is my first baby.
Please don't leave me here alone!

00:15:57.690 --> 00:16:01.050
B-But I have a very
important appointment.

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:02.810
Please!

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:12.350
Ma'am, the ambulance is here.

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:13.930
She's right here!

00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:19.430
You'll be all right now.

00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:27.870
You come with us, sir.

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:28.460
Huh?

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:32.100
Hurry! Get in!

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:36.180
NO! I'm just a passerby!

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:40.190
Hey! I'm on my
way to Mitsutomo!

00:16:40.530 --> 00:16:43.350
Please stay by my side!

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:46.250
I don't know what
your situation is,

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:48.170
but a man should take his
responsibilities seriously!

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:49.930
I'm trying to tell you...

00:16:51.960 --> 00:16:54.450
Let me off!!

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:02.580
It's just about interview time.

00:17:06.010 --> 00:17:08.450
I wonder how Godai's doing?

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:18.780
What's the matter, Ms. Otonashi?

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:20.430
Nothing.

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:22.660
You're not paying attention.

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:25.670
Don't worry about Godai.

00:17:25.910 --> 00:17:29.760
He's chummy with
the Recruiting Director.

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:31.730
I'm not-

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:34.930
There's nothing to fear but fear itself.

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:37.920
"There's nothing to fear but fear itself"?

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:56.250
Shall we begin, sir?

00:17:56.960 --> 00:17:58.510
Let's begin.

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:12.740
Let me off here!

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:17.540
Mitsutomo Corporation is
getting farther away.

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:22.660
Your wife is in tremendous pain.
Can't you be more quiet?!

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:24.250
But I'm-

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:34.340
It's all over.

00:18:34.970 --> 00:18:41.180
Don't worry. There's nothing
to fear but fear itself.

00:18:54.290 --> 00:18:57.220
You had that on you?

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:02.720
Maybe this was my destiny.

00:19:03.230 --> 00:19:05.060
Oh, the pain...

00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:07.460
This is for you, Ma'am.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.260
It's an amulet for an easy birth.

00:19:12.450 --> 00:19:14.440
Thank you.

00:19:15.270 --> 00:19:16.250
You're welcome.

00:19:18.740 --> 00:19:21.500
I see. It's his interview day.

00:19:21.780 --> 00:19:24.380
It's a chance of
a lifetime for Godai.

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:26.740
I hope he's doing okay.

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:32.650
If things go well, he'll be
a working man next spring.

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:34.190
Yes.

00:19:34.960 --> 00:19:38.630
Then he'll be a worthy rival.

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:39.960
Huh?

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:42.600
Ms. Otonashi, I'm looking
forward to the day

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:48.080
when you'll be able to choose
between two worthy men.

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:53.080
But it's not definite.

00:19:53.480 --> 00:19:54.460
Ms. Otonashi.

00:19:54.550 --> 00:19:55.420
Mitaka...

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:07.750
I'm okay. I'm okay.

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:15.490
I wish him luck.

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:18.640
Hang in there!
You're almost there!

00:21:25.270 --> 00:21:27.400
DELIVERY ROOM

00:22:00.970 --> 00:22:03.020
This concludes all
interviews for today.

00:22:03.390 --> 00:22:05.710
There should be
an interviewee named Godai.

00:22:06.120 --> 00:22:08.580
There aren't any other
interviewees here, sir.

00:22:09.190 --> 00:22:10.270
That can't be!

00:22:10.690 --> 00:22:12.850
Did you eliminate him
in the application process?

00:22:13.700 --> 00:22:15.690
You specifically instructed
us to keep him in the pool,

00:22:15.750 --> 00:22:17.210
so I'm sure that
wasn't the case.

00:22:18.490 --> 00:22:19.860
You're right, sir.
He was a no-show.

00:22:20.260 --> 00:22:20.890
What?

00:22:22.030 --> 00:22:24.220
He decided to skip our interview?

00:22:25.000 --> 00:22:27.020
He must be a brilliant student.

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:30.440
Mr. Yagami?

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:44.840
That Godai! How dare you
sneak away?!

00:22:45.950 --> 00:22:48.280
Damn!

00:22:59.470 --> 00:23:03.170
Congratulations. It's a boy.

00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:06.400
He looks just like his father!

00:23:17.160 --> 00:23:19.680
That amulet must have worked.

00:23:20.930 --> 00:23:23.780
Yes. The birth was much
easier than we expected.

00:23:27.030 --> 00:23:30.960
There's nothing to fear but fear itself.

00:23:45.490 --> 00:23:47.450
Hey! Come on out!

00:23:47.580 --> 00:23:48.300
Yagami!

00:23:48.380 --> 00:23:50.720
Your parents are worried sick!

00:23:50.790 --> 00:23:55.280
No! I won't go home until Dad
hires Mr. Godai!

00:23:55.360 --> 00:23:59.500
Next:
"Hostage Situation at Maison Ikkoku:
Yagami the Busybody"

00:23:59.560 --> 00:24:02.690
The passion of a high school girl
is simply amazing!
